    'Enrollment is run locally on the server PC. Run this exact command there:': { en: 'Enrollment is run locally on the server PC. Run this exact command there:', fr: 'L’inscription se fait localement sur le PC serveur. Exécutez-y cette commande exacte :', it: 'La registrazione si esegue localmente sul PC server. Esegui lì questo comando esatto:' },
    'Keep the recovery phrase OFF this PC in a secure place. Protect it carefully; Home Ledger will never ask you to enter or send it.': { en: 'Keep the recovery phrase OFF this PC in a secure place. Protect it carefully; Home Ledger will never ask you to enter or send it.', fr: 'Conservez la phrase de récupération HORS de ce PC, dans un endroit sûr. Protégez-la soigneusement ; Home Ledger ne vous demandera jamais de la saisir ou de l’envoyer.', it: 'Conserva la frase di recupero FUORI da questo PC in un luogo sicuro. Proteggila con cura; Home Ledger non ti chiederà mai di inserirla o inviarla.' },
    'This file is encrypted, but it remains on this device or PC until you choose a separate destination. Store it OFF the PC and protect the recovery phrase. Opening the share sheet does not mean the backup was saved.': { en: 'This file is encrypted, but it remains on this device or PC until you choose a separate destination. Store it OFF the PC and protect the recovery phrase. Opening the share sheet does not mean the backup was saved.', fr: 'Ce fichier est chiffré, mais reste sur cet appareil ou ce PC jusqu’à ce que vous choisissiez une autre destination. Stockez-le HORS du PC et protégez la phrase de récupération. L’ouverture du menu de partage ne signifie pas que la sauvegarde a été enregistrée.', it: 'Questo file è crittografato, ma resta su questo dispositivo o PC finché non scegli una destinazione separata. Conservalo FUORI dal PC e proteggi la frase di recupero. L’apertura del menu di condivisione non significa che il backup sia stato salvato.' },
    'Save encrypted backup': { en: 'Save encrypted backup', fr: 'Enregistrer la sauvegarde chiffrée', it: 'Salva backup crittografato' },
    'Save an encrypted copy directly to the mount configured on your server PC. Verify that it is your USB/NAS drive. Nothing is downloaded to this phone. The server must be enrolled and the mount available.': { en: 'Save an encrypted copy directly to the mount configured on your server PC. Verify that it is your USB/NAS drive. Nothing is downloaded to this phone. The server must be enrolled and the mount available.', fr: 'Enregistrez une copie chiffrée directement sur le volume configuré sur le PC serveur. Vérifiez qu’il s’agit bien de votre clé USB ou stockage NAS. Aucun fichier n’est téléchargé sur ce téléphone. La récupération doit être activée et le volume disponible.', it: 'Salva una copia crittografata direttamente sull’unità configurata sul PC server. Verifica che sia la tua unità USB/NAS. Nessun file viene scaricato sul telefono. Il ripristino deve essere attivato e l’unità disponibile.' },
