    'Encrypted backup saved on the server’s configured mount at ': { en: 'Encrypted backup saved on the server’s configured mount at ', fr: 'Sauvegarde chiffrée enregistrée sur le volume configuré du serveur à ', it: 'Backup crittografato salvato sull’unità configurata del server alle ' },
    'Verify that the configured mount is your USB/NAS drive.': { en: 'Verify that the configured mount is your USB/NAS drive.', fr: 'Vérifiez que le volume configuré est bien votre clé USB ou stockage NAS.', it: 'Verifica che l’unità configurata sia la tua unità USB/NAS.' },
